&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sunnydale represents what Southern Anne Arundel County does best: peaceful, rural-style living with waterfront access and rolling countryside. While you&amp;rsquo;re still in Anne Arundel County with all the county services and schools you&amp;rsquo;d expect, Sunnydale offers a different pace than the more developed northern and central county areas.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>